# The settings view (,): Hidden files turned off with Enter, the theme changed with ←, then a find.
size 60 20
file README.md # Hello\n
file notes.md text\n
dir src
file src/main.rs fn main() {}\n
state settings.json {"glyphs":"unicode","theme":"dark","updateCheck":false,"follow":false}
start
keys ,
keys down down down enter
keys up up up left
text /comp
until 2800
